      "content": "it's just hard to justify the struggle if the end is just... emptiness. if the darkness is inevitable anyway, why does it have to be such a slow, agonizing process? it feels like i'm just prolonging the inevitable. maybe it's better to just decide when it's time to turn the rest of them off.",
